<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose">
  <p>The index (<code>/assets/opinions.json</code>, written by <code>src/opinions.json.njk</code>) loads on first focus. While it loads the list says so; if it fails, the list says suggestions are unavailable and the page's own filter still works. The first option, <em>Show results for …</em>, filters the list on the search page rather than leaving it.</p>
  <p>Ranking: a name that starts with the text, then a name with a word that does, then a match anywhere in the name, court or citations; at most six.</p>
</div>
{{ table(["Key", "Does"], [
