  ["Escape", "Closes the list"],
  ["Tab", "Closes the list and moves on"]
]) }}

<h2 class="g-h2" id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The input is the combobox and keeps focus; <code>aria-activedescendant</code> points at the active option. Typing with an input method (Chinese, Japanese) waits for composition to end before suggesting.</p></div>

